{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You shall not join your hand with a wicked man.</b> To sign a document with him, as they said of the people of Jerusalem that they would not sign a document unless they knew who was signing with them (Sanhedrin 23a)." "<b>To be a witness of violence.</b> That you testify as a solitary witness — for the wicked man is unfit to testify — and the judge would extract all the money from the defendant on your word alone, contrary to law."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:52.126611477Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}